# Plugins

## Framework semantics

Plugins are Composer-distributed CakePHP packages loaded by the application with their own namespaces, bootstrap, routes, and services.

## Required behavior

- Confirm a plugin is installed/loaded before using its APIs.
- Prefer plugin extension points over reimplementation.
- Keep application-specific domain logic in the app unless extracting a real shared plugin.

## Anti-patterns

- Plugin API reimplementation
- Recommending unloaded plugin APIs